    <section class="local-content">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Electrical work for your home</h2>
            <p>Bremray is a licensed and insured electrical contractor based in Ann Arbor. We've served the area since 2004. Tell us what you want to add, replace, or repair. We'll help you work out what the job needs.</p>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/ev-charger-installation.html">EV charger installation</a></h3>
                    <p>Charge at home where you park. We'll check the charger, the route for the wiring, and the power available before we plan the installation.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/electrical-panel-upgrade.html">Panel upgrades</a></h3>
                    <p>Adding equipment or concerned about your panel? We'll look at what you have and explain whether you need a repair, a replacement, or more electrical capacity.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/generators.html">Backup generators</a></h3>
                    <p>Tell us what you want to keep running during an outage. We'll help you compare an automatic standby generator with a connection for a portable generator.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3><a href="/residential-electrical.html">Lights, outlets, and repairs</a></h3>
                    <p>We add lights, ceiling fans, outlets, and circuits. We also find and repair problems when something stops working.</p>
                </article>
            </div>

            <h3>Want to know what the job will cost?</h3>
            <p>Start with a few details about the work. For an installation, tell us what you're adding and where it will go. For a repair, tell us what happened and when it started. We'll review your request and follow up. Some jobs need a visit before we can give you a price.</p>

            <h3>Ann Arbor and nearby communities</h3>
            <p>We work throughout Ann Arbor and Washtenaw County. We also serve <a href="/locations/ypsilanti-electrician.html">Ypsilanti</a>, <a href="/locations/saline-electrician.html">Saline</a>, and <a href="/locations/chelsea-electrician.html">Chelsea</a>. Include the job's ZIP code in your request.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

